And a pure helper:
```python
def diff_mentions_assertion_shape(diff_text: str) -> bool:
    """-U0 TEXT heuristic. NOT a count of loosened assertions."""
    for line in diff_text.splitlines():
        if not line or line[0] not in "+-":
            continue
        if line.startswith("+++") or line.startswith("---"):
            continue
        body = line[1:]
        if any(m in body for m in FIX_LOOP_ASSERTION_MARKERS):
            return True
